    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it doesnt feel like i have \"worth\" to find. it feels like i just traded my whole life for a moral victory that nobody even cares about. everything is just empty. it's like i'm just a ghost walking around a life that isn't mine anymore. how am i supposed to keep doing this every single day when there is literally nothing to look forward to?",
