      "content": "\"walk away from a life that no longer serves you\"... what does that even mean? it feels like you're saying there's no point in even trying to rebuild. like, if the whole world is just this broken, corrupt mess, why should i bother fighting to exist in it? it just feels so much easier to just... stop.",
